# StepFun's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-stepfun-setting-token = 您的 StepFun Oasis-Token。登录 https://platform.stepfun.com，打开开发者工具 > Application > Cookies 中的 platform.stepfun.com，复制 Oasis-Token Cookie 的值。同时需要设置 webid。
usage-stepfun-setting-webid = platform.stepfun.com 上 Oasis-Token 旁的 Oasis-Webid Cookie 的值。若令牌附带其他设备的 Web ID，StepFun 会拒绝。
usage-stepfun-setting-cookie = 替代 token 和 webid：登录 https://platform.stepfun.com，打开开发者工具 > Application > Cookies 中的 platform.stepfun.com，将 Oasis-Token 和 Oasis-Webid Cookie 复制为 "Oasis-Token=…; Oasis-Webid=…"。

## The report: a credit plan's monthly credit, as a usage window. Plan
## names stay as StepFun sends them.

usage-stepfun-credit = 额度
